WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Xuba umhlabathi ongaphezulu ovela ezindaweni eziningana embhedeni. Susa amatshe, izimpande namaqabunga.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Faka umhlabathi engxenyeni yesithathu yembiza. Faka amanzi nensipho yezitsha. Vala, unyakazise, uyibeke phansi.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Ngemva komzuzu owodwa, isihlabathi sesizinzile phansi. Maka ingaphezulu longqimba lwaso.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Ngemva kwamahora amabili, maka ingaphezulu longqimba olulandelayo. Lolu ungqimba lwezinhlayiya ezibizwa nge-silt.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Hlola ngemva kosuku olulodwa noma kwezinsuku ezimbili. Uma amanzi esecwebe kakhulu, maka ungqimba lobumba. Okuntantayo kuvela ezintweni ebeziphila.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Qhathanisa ukuphakama kongqimba ngalunye nokuphakama kwawo wonke umhlabathi ozinze embizeni.
